          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this curling iron suitable for professional stylists?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The 1000W motor and rapid heat technology make it powerful enough for professional use, though it's marketed as an at-home styler. Professionals can achieve salon-quality results with the three heat settings and quick-change attachment system.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "row_WNVNE6": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the Curlear Long Barrel Curling Iron work for different hair types?",
            "content": "<p>The device features intelligent heat control and anti-frizz airflow that adapts to all hair types (straight, curly, wavy, fine, thick). The technology reduces frizz and prevents damage regardless of hair type.</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "row_AbeeeE": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What barrel sizes are available for the long barrel curling iron?",
